From 1994984f06638a402ae8b2d02b8ff6bf6c5c1f81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:02:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire: usbpd, dwc3-msm: reconstruct the stock Xiaomi
 drivers

usbpd: CLO r1-12800 policy engine plus the Xiaomi changes recovered from
the stock module: Charging_Adapter/pd_adapter sysfs (current_state,
usbpd_verifed, adapter_id, adapter_svid, verify_process, adapter_version,
request_vdm_cmd), SVID 0x2717 authentication handler, PPS/PD limits from
DT (mi,pd_curr_limit, mi,non-qcom-pps-ctrl, ...), the exports used by the
Xiaomi charger stack (smb_get_usbpd, usbpd_select_pdo, usbpd_fetch_pdo,
usbpd_get_pps_status, usbpd_get_src_cap_id). Exports 15/15 stock CRCs.

dwc3-msm: CLO r1-12500 base (release_ss_lane, is_superspeed, debug
kretprobes) plus Xiaomi delayed resume work and 5 s roothub autosuspend.
Exports 10/10 stock CRCs; data objects byte-identical.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
